        // ---- weapons -------------------------------------------------------------------
        // Every Naga gun speaks the same way (docs/STYLE.md "The Naga suite"): a deep
        // compression thump as the pinch lets go, under a cannon's crack and the report's
        // body, the slug's dark buzz falling away, and a short low sizzle behind. No pews,
        // no zaps: nothing bright above the crack's first milliseconds.
